ContextBench turn source for Harbor 0.16 terminus-2: the in-place equivalent of
contextbench.harbor.agents.Terminus2Stream, for people who prefer patching Harbor.

Apply from the site-packages directory that contains harbor/:
    patch -p1 < harbor-0.16-terminus2-turn-source.patch
Then run terminus-2 with --agent-kwarg contextbench_stream=true. With the kwarg
unset (the default) the agent behaves exactly as before. Requires contextbench to
be importable by the harbor process. Generated against harbor 0.16.1.

